ner Schools\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We are thrilled to announce a new partnership with Servite\n              Catholic School from Laurel, Batangas, and STI College San Pablo,\n              marking an exciting collaboration for our Senior High School Work\n              Immersion Program. This partnership strengthens our mission to\n              equip students with real-world industry experience and technical\n              skills.\n            </p>\n            <table\n              cellpadding=\"0\"\n              cellspacing=\"0\"\n              role=\"presentation\"\n              style=\"width: 683px; height: 0px; padding: 0; text-align: center\"\n            >\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP5eyl4ebCTtx4A-8hqxXvGi8cV8aknwp0i7511iRMyXJwy4gQ9nD0K8cot0Y5fYIkwnhsMD9JOEgamPiQa4__e1hANZfWu3NHDk1YF-6-mOi1nb4E=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/fbs-announces-new-partnership-with-servite-catholic-school\"\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        color: #f2f2f2;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN2XTZ2NLLkxgPfvpYMvENokjUe-zRf-QmdyNYleAKDCDyqOkXzvsYK9VT7OUigPd3qvOH1dFlPtWVaBLnDtngJ7Bn8jeYBWFrxw5OmB9XP8JlWP_M=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/FBS%20Partners%20with%20STI%20College%20San%20Pablo%20for%20ICT%20Work%20Immersion%20Program\"\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        color: #f2f2f2;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- NEW PARTNER MOBILE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"partnerMobile\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fff\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              FBS Welcomes New Partner Schools\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We are thrilled to announce a new partnership with Servite\n              Catholic School from Laurel, Batangas, and STI College San Pablo,\n              marking an exciting collaboration for our Senior High School Work\n              Immersion Program. This partnership strengthens our mission to\n              equip students with real-world industry experience and technical\n              skills.\n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center\">\n              <li class=\"partnerMobile--block1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 32px\">\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP5eyl4ebCTtx4A-8hqxXvGi8cV8aknwp0i7511iRMyXJwy4gQ9nD0K8cot0Y5fYIkwnhsMD9JOEgamPiQa4__e1hANZfWu3NHDk1YF-6-mOi1nb4E=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/fbs-announces-new-partnership-with-servite-catholic-school\"\n                    style=\"\n                      text-align: center;\n                      color: #f2f2f2;\n                      font-weight: 300;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"partnerMobile--block2\">\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN2XTZ2NLLkxgPfvpYMvENokjUe-zRf-QmdyNYleAKDCDyqOkXzvsYK9VT7OUigPd3qvOH1dFlPtWVaBLnDtngJ7Bn8jeYBWFrxw5OmB9XP8JlWP_M=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/FBS%20Partners%20with%20STI%20College%20San%20Pablo%20for%20ICT%20Work%20Immersion%20Program\"\n                    style=\"\n                      text-align: center;\n                      color: #f2f2f2;\n                      font-weight: 300;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- RENEWAL DESKTOP -->\n          <div class=\"renewalDesktop\" style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px\">\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Renewed Partnership with San Pablo Colleges\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <table\n              cellpadding=\"0\"\n              cellspacing=\"0\"\n              role=\"presentation\"\n              style=\"\n                width: 683px;\n                height: 0px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: center;\n                margin-top: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwHge9CzLKfgH2gJ271yT54CdtXVqfXY8ppcZQUqqEQFNg6V7-KIVSrEvx0HxZWZ4e_hRn4K_QsBDtQyOBU5ehF2exMrPu5QaCuKbkpD5I9RIByV4=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 330px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/SPC-Renews-Partnership-with-FBS\"\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        color: #f2f2f2;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                    FBS is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with\n                    San Pablo Colleges for their Senior High School Work\n                    Immersion Program this 2025. This continued collaboration\n                    underscores both institutions\' shared commitment to\n                    providing students with invaluable real-world experience and\n                    practical skills that will prepare them for future career\n                    success.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- RENEWAL MOBILE -->\n          <div class=\"renewalMobile\" style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px\">\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Renewed Partnership with San Pablo Colleges\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center\">\n              <li\n                class=\"renewalMobile--block1\"\n                style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px\"\n              >\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwHge9CzLKfgH2gJ271yT54CdtXVqfXY8ppcZQUqqEQFNg6V7-KIVSrEvx0HxZWZ4e_hRn4K_QsBDtQyOBU5ehF2exMrPu5QaCuKbkpD5I9RIByV4=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/SPC-Renews-Partnership-with-FBS\"\n                    style=\"\n                      text-align: center;\n                      color: #f2f2f2;\n                      font-weight: 300;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"renewalMobile--block2\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                  FBS is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with\n                  San Pablo Colleges for their Senior High School Work Immersion\n                  Program this 2025. This continued collaboration underscores\n                  both institutions\' shared commitment to providing students\n                  with invaluable real-world experience and practical skills\n                  that will prepare them for future career success.\n                </p>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fff\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              February Company Fellowship\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              As February is known as the month of love, Frontline Business\n              Solutions, Inc. embraced this spirit of unity and camaraderie\n              through our monthly company fellowship. With the theme \"Raising\n              the Bar, Reaching Far, the event served as a reminder of our\n              commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and teamwork.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOyEKEISbrEc4h1GvtlLfL1iNJPgisPEqqwds3WoMeyT4iZS8rQTz6y9hGeZ-r46zYT8-Nn5cch6OtS_o02e-SnsapZR3vWA_zx1wau9lVIAjb_xK0=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 657px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/webapp-hris\"\n                style=\"\n                  text-align: center;\n                  color: #f2f2f2;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FOOTER -->\n          <div\n            class=\"footer\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #333\"\n          >\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczMwywpNwM3ypEY8Ex92PNahXs0Jghx8fViZ8RvD4Lej1JKn63j5hfcnM2MBrI_stYKXy9qVxg3CmRP9o3XiVnnumuCSiZe6fZTnkXIycFGNHBX7QS8=w2400\"\n                alt=\"\"\n                style=\"\n                  width: 300px;\n                  display: block;\n                  margin-left: auto;\n                  margin-right: auto;\n                \"\n              />\n            </a>\n            <h3 style=\"color: #fff; text-align: center; margin: 16px 0\">\n              Your Trusted Christian Partner <br />\n              in Managed Services\n            </h3>\n            <p\n              style=\"\n                color: #fff;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: 12px;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              We deliver end-to-end solutions and professional expertise in\n              <br />\n              web applications, websites, virtual assistants, and skills\n              development.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"icons\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.facebook.com/frontline.business\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNEy4pqCkdZ3TI2U5_ty1rsyAr287bs1MKnE9is6Wfvg9JYCZ5AuEqQHD7jyKVINg7Oy2P6ntdVGi8qkzby1H4P2XlaoqSsrNkIQkQ9FyhWBea3x6E=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/frontline-business-solutions-inc/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPi3buvL5Un9DyKoGLP0zaolXrXyV7hP8M8IwAcvxWiaysuZxscVzw9hReEoP5j5xr1-F3Fx1JI32UEmV3pv949c33m1JbEedeUHbxh1JrcxkHxlP8=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frontlinebusinesssolutions6578\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOFaymIU4G3nFFhSiWbsv-JRGDD31-RCXOyDulqVuIEldQDH-04FJBepWSVQRk0iTxi1Pf4hY_SoNIEEdoWBxmWXAwLX3ePScXnh-LM5846LaM6O8s=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.instagram.com/frontline.business/\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczPPsABBWthmMwhMnRaz0NxOwLNe_F5dyau9JBbQUAbT48kN5S7WKa1_M6SSb6awE4kFyDiIKv7prYY2wCPNfYegju-Ph0xjM9khTrzBbAb0eY8AUwA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n              <a\n                href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@frontlinebusinessinc\"\n                style=\"display: inline-block\"\n                ><img\n                  style=\"width: 25px; height: 25px\"\n                  src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNF50VT3hd-2PhvM_OUWALWmBgwrHp3drnQM-wGSSP5-C-RHXP-HePnxs4W-f8dDzun14Jth78npNTahLoR-9snETM5vsIPBBvdXzJfqPS8-eYZwiA=s70-p-k\"\n                  alt=\"\"\n              /></a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1\">\n              <p style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #fff\">\n                <small>\n                  Copyright 2025, All rights reserved. <br />\n                  Baloc Road, Brgy, San Ignacio, San Pablo City, Laguna\n                  Philippines 4000<br />\n                  <br />\n                  You are receiving this email because you opted in at our\n                  website. <br />\n                  \n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </body>\n</html>', 1, '47e26eaffab557f0aea866fb313e311a713431a378080cf9210c02ddce4776e0', '2025-03-03 11:00:20', '0000-00-00 00:00:00');
INSERT INTO `fbsv2_sending_email_log` (`sending_email_log_aid`, `sending_email_log_is_active`, `sending_email_log_audience_id`, `sending_email_log_email`, `sending_email_log_subject`, `sending_email_log_content`, `sending_email_log_is_success`, `sending_email_log_key`, `sending_email_log_created`, `sending_email_log_datetime`) VALUES
(5, 1, 8, 'louren.rubico@frontlinebusiness.com.ph', 'test 5', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>FBS Marketing Website Newsletter</title>\n    <!-- CSS -->\n    <style>\n      * {\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        /* outline: 1px solid red; */\n      }\n      body {\n        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif !important;\n        color: #333;\n      }\n      .canvas {\n        width: 700px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n      }\n      table {\n        border-spacing: 0;\n      }\n      .welcomeMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .welcomeDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .partnerMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .partnerDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .renewalMobile {\n        display: none;\n      }\n      .renewalDesktop {\n        display: block;\n      }\n      .partnerMobile--block1 img,\n      .partnerMobile--block2 img,\n      .renewalMobile--block1 img {\n        width: 100% !important;\n      }\n      @media screen and (min-width: 340px) and (max-width: 520px) {\n        .canvas {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;\n        }\n        .container {\n          width: 100% !important;\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          margin: 0 auto !important;\n        }\n        .newsLetter {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n        }\n        table {\n          width: 520px !important;\n        }\n        .title {\n          padding: 0 !important;\n          background-size: 100vw !important;\n          height: 127px !important;\n        }\n        .welcomeMobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .welcomeDesktop {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .partnerMobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .partnerMobile--block2 {\n          margin-top: 70px;\n        }\n        .partnerDesktop {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .renewalMobile {\n          display: block;\n        }\n        .renewalDesktop {\n          display: none;\n        }\n        .fellowship img {\n          width: 100% !important;\n        }\n      }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <section class=\"newsLetter\" style=\"background-color: white; padding: 0\">\n      <div\n        class=\"container\"\n        style=\"width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: white\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"canvas\">\n          <!-- TITLE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"title\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOdZtJGJfu6DvsKfNErCpQjezh3fLHVMunDqwfWy4u1ExSkRcXh88-7V1X6SZkIkaKWRLj2Lac9thC6d7piVDPawLj384xlMm2nU3oO3t936Lzrd6g=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 205px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- BACKGROUND IMAGE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"imageSeperator\"\n            style=\"\n              background-image: url(\'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOlbKgxTNTJPezw5X1Bs5_IGWvWP1N8Hzf0SEqnnTUdYg6xGzGXFffsG-TxSMvtcE7oEQjyi-APGKQD-iRrjAEGUFMBGB-xZfN5wXJtCuMO6BrL4Ks=w2400\');\n              background-repeat: no-repeat;\n              background-size: cover;\n              background-position: center;\n              height: 350px;\n              border: none;\n            \"\n          ></div>\n          <!-- DESC -->\n          <div\n            class=\"desc\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fff\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Why Virtual Assistants Are the Secret Weapon <br />\n              for Business Success?\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Know the game-changer in running your business.\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              Imagine waking up to an endless to-do list-emails, social media\n              updates, and admin tasks piling up. Sound familiar? As a business\n              owner, managing everything alone can be overwhelming. But what if\n              you didn\'t have to?\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px\">\n              With Virtual Assistance Services, your business stays efficient\n              while you focus on what matters most.\n            </p>\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n              <a\n                class=\"btn\"\n                href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/insight/why-virtual-assistants-are-the-secret-weapon-for-business-success\"\n                style=\"\n                  color: #f2f2f2;\n                  font-weight: 300;\n                  padding: 12px 50px;\n                  background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                  border-radius: 5px;\n                  text-decoration: none;\n                  font-size: 12px;\n                \"\n                >Read more</a\n              >\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <!-- WELCOME MESSAGE DESKTOP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"welcomeDesktop\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Welcoming Our New Clients in Virtual <br />\n              Assistance & Social Media Management\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Virtual Assistant Solutions\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We\'re excited to welcome our newest clients who have entrusted us\n              with their Virtual Assistant and Social Media Management needs! At\n              Frontline Business Solutions, we\'re committed to helping\n              businesses streamline operations and enhance their online\n              presence.\n            </p>\n            <table\n              cellpadding=\"0\"\n              cellspacing=\"0\"\n              role=\"presentation\"\n              style=\"width: 650px; height: 0px; padding: 0\"\n            >\n              <tr>\n                <td class=\"logo\" style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"10%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\"\n                    ><img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNfTex3xE76-6CADK0b8cNVYsBsebvnarT6DIm-FSDjfu02i0cejzosawR6EkX11rWmPf67iUOsExL5uspYjKCmOSCZ7jtRrkY228W9U2qSVJIiS6k=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"width: 200px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block\"\n                  /></a>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"logo\" style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"10%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\"\n                    ><img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNoAEDCWerM_QYoXkQXxMHb4SBDNUrYZs-KQKBPitwaIYmdGwRjebcn83zL0C7XrcWqy4R0tKYJiAZ2t6nhrs01ia9N_ZrpuKI0WH4Kx-PeJAy4U_I=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"width: 200px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block\"\n                  /></a>\n                </td>\n                <td class=\"logo\" style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"10%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\"\n                    ><img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNtdnMngU7j9l7ahetEDv6SqczX-YPorQjoU9Kl5EN5siZI06pmj3U-fpUcw6BfpbcNUc_EoIWQPAMDCUqfjS1_QNCpzvkEMFCD2YOO8buTduJnHWs=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"width: 200px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: block\"\n                  /></a>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- WELCOME MESSAGE MOBILE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"welcomeMobile\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fef7ed\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Welcoming Our New Clients in Virtual Assistance & Social Media\n              Management\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Virtual Assistant Solutions\n            </small>\n\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We\'re excited to welcome our newest clients who have entrusted us\n              with their Virtual Assistant and Social Media Management needs! At\n              Frontline Business Solutions, we\'re committed to helping\n              businesses streamline operations and enhance their online\n              presence.\n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center\">\n              <li>\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                  ><img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNfTex3xE76-6CADK0b8cNVYsBsebvnarT6DIm-FSDjfu02i0cejzosawR6EkX11rWmPf67iUOsExL5uspYjKCmOSCZ7jtRrkY228W9U2qSVJIiS6k=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"\n                      width: 250px;\n                      margin-bottom: 16px;\n                      display: block;\n                      margin-left: auto;\n                      margin-right: auto;\n                    \"\n                /></a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                  ><img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNoAEDCWerM_QYoXkQXxMHb4SBDNUrYZs-KQKBPitwaIYmdGwRjebcn83zL0C7XrcWqy4R0tKYJiAZ2t6nhrs01ia9N_ZrpuKI0WH4Kx-PeJAy4U_I=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"\n                      width: 250px;\n                      margin-bottom: 16px;\n                      display: block;\n                      margin-left: auto;\n                      margin-right: auto;\n                    \"\n                /></a>\n              </li>\n              <li>\n                <a href=\"#\"\n                  ><img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNtdnMngU7j9l7ahetEDv6SqczX-YPorQjoU9Kl5EN5siZI06pmj3U-fpUcw6BfpbcNUc_EoIWQPAMDCUqfjS1_QNCpzvkEMFCD2YOO8buTduJnHWs=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                    style=\"\n                      width: 250px;\n                      margin-bottom: 16px;\n                      display: block;\n                      margin-left: auto;\n                      margin-right: auto;\n                    \"\n                /></a>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- NEW PARTNER DESKTOP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"partnerDesktop\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fff\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              FBS Welcomes New Partner Schools\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We are thrilled to announce a new partnership with Servite\n              Catholic School from Laurel, Batangas, and STI College San Pablo,\n              marking an exciting collaboration for our Senior High School Work\n              Immersion Program. This partnership strengthens our mission to\n              equip students with real-world industry experience and technical\n              skills.\n            </p>\n            <table\n              cellpadding=\"0\"\n              cellspacing=\"0\"\n              role=\"presentation\"\n              style=\"width: 683px; height: 0px; padding: 0; text-align: center\"\n            >\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP5eyl4ebCTtx4A-8hqxXvGi8cV8aknwp0i7511iRMyXJwy4gQ9nD0K8cot0Y5fYIkwnhsMD9JOEgamPiQa4__e1hANZfWu3NHDk1YF-6-mOi1nb4E=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/fbs-announces-new-partnership-with-servite-catholic-school\"\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        color: #f2f2f2;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN2XTZ2NLLkxgPfvpYMvENokjUe-zRf-QmdyNYleAKDCDyqOkXzvsYK9VT7OUigPd3qvOH1dFlPtWVaBLnDtngJ7Bn8jeYBWFrxw5OmB9XP8JlWP_M=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 317px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/FBS%20Partners%20with%20STI%20College%20San%20Pablo%20for%20ICT%20Work%20Immersion%20Program\"\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        color: #f2f2f2;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- NEW PARTNER MOBILE -->\n          <div\n            class=\"partnerMobile\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fff\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              FBS Welcomes New Partner Schools\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              We are thrilled to announce a new partnership with Servite\n              Catholic School from Laurel, Batangas, and STI College San Pablo,\n              marking an exciting collaboration for our Senior High School Work\n              Immersion Program. This partnership strengthens our mission to\n              equip students with real-world industry experience and technical\n              skills.\n            </p>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center\">\n              <li class=\"partnerMobile--block1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 32px\">\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczP5eyl4ebCTtx4A-8hqxXvGi8cV8aknwp0i7511iRMyXJwy4gQ9nD0K8cot0Y5fYIkwnhsMD9JOEgamPiQa4__e1hANZfWu3NHDk1YF-6-mOi1nb4E=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/fbs-announces-new-partnership-with-servite-catholic-school\"\n                    style=\"\n                      text-align: center;\n                      color: #f2f2f2;\n                      font-weight: 300;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"partnerMobile--block2\">\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczN2XTZ2NLLkxgPfvpYMvENokjUe-zRf-QmdyNYleAKDCDyqOkXzvsYK9VT7OUigPd3qvOH1dFlPtWVaBLnDtngJ7Bn8jeYBWFrxw5OmB9XP8JlWP_M=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/FBS%20Partners%20with%20STI%20College%20San%20Pablo%20for%20ICT%20Work%20Immersion%20Program\"\n                    style=\"\n                      text-align: center;\n                      color: #f2f2f2;\n                      font-weight: 300;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- RENEWAL DESKTOP -->\n          <div class=\"renewalDesktop\" style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px\">\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Renewed Partnership with San Pablo Colleges\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <table\n              cellpadding=\"0\"\n              cellspacing=\"0\"\n              role=\"presentation\"\n              style=\"\n                width: 683px;\n                height: 0px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: center;\n                margin-top: 16px;\n              \"\n            >\n              <tr>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <a href=\"#\">\n                    <img\n                      src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwHge9CzLKfgH2gJ271yT54CdtXVqfXY8ppcZQUqqEQFNg6V7-KIVSrEvx0HxZWZ4e_hRn4K_QsBDtQyOBU5ehF2exMrPu5QaCuKbkpD5I9RIByV4=w2400\"\n                      alt=\"\"\n                      style=\"display: block; width: 330px\"\n                    />\n                  </a>\n                  <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                    <a\n                      class=\"btn\"\n                      href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/SPC-Renews-Partnership-with-FBS\"\n                      style=\"\n                        text-align: center;\n                        color: #f2f2f2;\n                        font-weight: 300;\n                        padding: 12px 50px;\n                        background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                        border-radius: 5px;\n                        text-decoration: none;\n                        font-size: 12px;\n                      \"\n                      >Read more</a\n                    >\n                  </div>\n                </td>\n                <td style=\"vertical-align: top\" width=\"50%\">\n                  <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                    FBS is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with\n                    San Pablo Colleges for their Senior High School Work\n                    Immersion Program this 2025. This continued collaboration\n                    underscores both institutions\' shared commitment to\n                    providing students with invaluable real-world experience and\n                    practical skills that will prepare them for future career\n                    success.\n                  </p>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n          <!-- RENEWAL MOBILE -->\n          <div class=\"renewalMobile\" style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px\">\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              Renewed Partnership with San Pablo Colleges\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Learning Center Solutions Service\n            </small>\n\n            <ul style=\"list-style: none; text-align: center\">\n              <li\n                class=\"renewalMobile--block1\"\n                style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 32px\"\n              >\n                <a href=\"#\">\n                  <img\n                    src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczNwHge9CzLKfgH2gJ271yT54CdtXVqfXY8ppcZQUqqEQFNg6V7-KIVSrEvx0HxZWZ4e_hRn4K_QsBDtQyOBU5ehF2exMrPu5QaCuKbkpD5I9RIByV4=w2400\"\n                    alt=\"\"\n                  />\n                </a>\n                <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 26px\">\n                  <a\n                    class=\"btn\"\n                    href=\"https://frontlinebusiness.com.ph/events-and-activities/SPC-Renews-Partnership-with-FBS\"\n                    style=\"\n                      text-align: center;\n                      color: #f2f2f2;\n                      font-weight: 300;\n                      padding: 12px 50px;\n                      background: linear-gradient(to right, #6a1142, #d60070);\n                      border-radius: 5px;\n                      text-decoration: none;\n                      font-size: 12px;\n                    \"\n                    >Read more</a\n                  >\n                </div>\n              </li>\n              <li class=\"renewalMobile--block2\">\n                <p style=\"text-align: left\">\n                  FBS is proud to announce the renewal of its partnership with\n                  San Pablo Colleges for their Senior High School Work Immersion\n                  Program this 2025. This continued collaboration underscores\n                  both institutions\' shared commitment to providing students\n                  with invaluable real-world experience and practical skills\n                  that will prepare them for future career success.\n                </p>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <!-- FELLOWSHIP -->\n          <div\n            class=\"fellowship\"\n            style=\"padding: 32px 17px 48px; background-color: #fff\"\n          >\n            <h2\n              style=\"\n                font-weight: 900;\n                font-size: 25.3px;\n                line-height: 30px;\n                margin-bottom: 1px;\n                margin-top: 0;\n              \"\n            >\n              February Company Fellowship\n            </h2>\n            <small style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #d60070\">\n              Company Culture and Team Building\n            </small>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14px; margin: 20px 0\">\n              As February is known as the month of love, Frontline Business\n              Solutions, Inc. embraced this spirit of unity and camaraderie\n              through our monthly company fellowship. With the theme \"Raising\n              the Bar, Reaching Far, the event served as a reminder of our\n              commitment to continuous growth, excellence, and teamwork.\n            </p>\n            <a href=\"\">\n              <img\n                src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AP1GczOyEKEISbrEc4h1GvtlLfL1iNJPg